{"articleNo":"63456","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=63456&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012-2학기 대구통학버스 하교 좌석 예약제 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.03","hit":"5817","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 24pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">대구통학버스 하교 좌석</font><font color=\"#0900ff\"> 예약제 안내문</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;대구통학버스를 운행함에 있어 하교 버스 승차 대기를 위해 줄서기 하는 불편을 해소하고자 좌석예약제(70%)를 다음과 같이 시행하오니 참고하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">1. 정상예약 운영기간(하교)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 운행기간 : 2012. 9. 3(월) ~ 12. 21(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 대상구간 : 하교 운행차량 전 구간(34회)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">. 예약방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 예약장소 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">Kit 라운지</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">(교내 시내버스정류장 옆)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\"> 1대</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">도서관 1층 로비 1대</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 예약시간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">차량 출발 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">3</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">시간 전부터</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (첫차일 경우 12:20부터 예약 가능)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 